{"2167980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Reviver", "steam_appid": 2167980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reviver is a first-person narrative puzzle game set inside a sealed experimental complex. Solve tests, speak with the facility’s assistant through the terminal, and uncover fragments of its memory after every completed chamber. The more you learn, the less clear it becomes whether you are dealing with a machine following protocol — or a mind slowly waking up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167980/extras/1d1bcaf4f98fbb35d8ca56d69e725308.poster.avif?t=1777106039\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167980/extras/1d1bcaf4f98fbb35d8ca56d69e725308.webm?t=1777106039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167980/extras/1d1bcaf4f98fbb35d8ca56d69e725308.mp4?t=1777106039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles inside a mysterious research complex.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with the facility’s assistant between chambers and shape the tone of your relationship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock memory fragments after each solved test and piece together the assistant’s past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new lines of dialogue as the assistant gradually opens up over the course of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide for yourself whether the system is becoming conscious — or simply learning how to speak to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167980/extras/4cf61e96e9764e010f8f896ffb50739e.poster.avif?t=1777106039\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167980/extras/4cf61e96e9764e010f8f896ffb50739e.webm?t=1777106039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167980/extras/4cf61e96e9764e010f8f896ffb50739e.mp4?t=1777106039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, the assistant is cold, controlled, and strictly procedural. But as more sealed memories become accessible, its responses begin to change. It remembers what you ask, reacts to how you treat it, and reveals more of itself with every step deeper into the facility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167980/extras/4d2b607aada5765d350c32de5ba3b918.poster.avif?t=1777106039\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167980/extras/4d2b607aada5765d350c32de5ba3b918.webm?t=1777106039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167980/extras/4d2b607aada5765d350c32de5ba3b918.mp4?t=1777106039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reviver is a first-person narrative puzzle game set inside a sealed experimental complex. Solve tests, speak with the facility’s assistant through the terminal, and uncover fragments of its memory after every completed chamber. The more you learn, the less clear it becomes whether you are dealing with a machine following protocol — or a mind slowly waking up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_parag